fn\">(∀ {<span class=\"fn\">x </span><span class=\"fn\">y</span> : <span class=\"fn\">E</span>}, <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Internal/Order/Basic.html#Lean.Order.PartialOrder.rel\">Lean.Order.PartialOrder.rel</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">toEStack</span> <span class=\"fn\">x</span>)</span> <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">toEStack</span> <span class=\"fn\">y</span>)</span></span> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Internal/Order/Basic.html#Lean.Order.PartialOrder.rel\">Lean.Order.PartialOrder.rel</a> <span class=\"fn\">x</span> <span class=\"fn\">y</span></span></span>)</span> →\n            <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Std/WP/EStack.html#Std.WP.ToEStack\">Std.WP.ToEStack</a> <span class=\"fn\">E</span> <span class=\"fn\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Std/WP/EStack.html#Std.WP.ToEStack.mk","kind":"ctor","line":87,"name":"Std.WP.ToEStack.mk","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Std/WP/EStack.lean#L87-L93"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">class</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/WP/EStack.html#Std.WP.ToEStack\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">WP</span>.<span class=\"name\">ToEStack</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">E</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">T</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#outParam\">outParam</a> <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">(Type</a> u)</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Std/WP/Assertion.html#Std.WP.Assertion\">Assertion</a> <span class=\"fn\">E</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Std/WP/Assertion.html#Std.WP.Assertion\">Assertion</a> <span class=\"fn\">T</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u</div></div>","info":{"doc":"`toEStack` exposes the exception postconditions `E` as a stack. Example: `Thrown` with the field\n`onThrow : String → Prop` has `toEStack t = estack⟨t.onThrow⟩`, and `vcgen` weakens `onThrow`.","docLink":"./Std/WP/EStack.html#Std.WP.ToEStack","kind":"class","line":87,"name":"Std.WP.ToEStack","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Std/WP/EStack.lean#L87-L93"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/WP/EStack.html#Std.WP.EStackEnd.bot_eq\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">WP</span>.<span class=\"name\">EStackEnd</span>.<span class=\"name\">bot_eq</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Internal/Order/Basic.html#Lean.Order.CCPO\">Lean.Order.CCPO</a> <a href=\"./Std/WP/EStack.html#Std.WP.EStackEnd\">EStack⟨</a><a href=\"./Std/WP/EStack.html#Std.WP.EStackEnd\">⟩</a></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Internal/Order/Basic.html#Lean.Order.bot\">Lean.Order.bot</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <a href=\"./Std/WP/EStack.html#Std.WP.EStackEnd.mk\">estack⟨</a><a href=\"./Std/WP/EStack.html#Std.WP.EStackEnd.mk\">⟩</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`⊥` at the end of an exception postcondition stack is the empty stack value.","docLink":"./Std/WP/EStack.html#Std.WP.EStackEnd.bot_eq","kind":"theorem","line":83,"name":"Std.WP.EStackEnd.bot_eq","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc0